-inline-block">Land Enquiry</h1></div></div></div></div><div class="d-lg-flex breadcrumb pt-3 pt-lg-4 bg-gray fw-600 align-items-center fs-12 fw-400 px-lg-5 px-md-3 px-2 text-white"><p class="brd-crum-bb"><a href="/" class="text-b px-0 sec_subtitle text-capitalize fw-100">Home</a></p></div><section class="sec-padd position-relative overflow-hidden"><div class="container"><div class="g-4 align-items-center flex-lg-row flex-column-reverse row"><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-12"><div class="head_wrap"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="sec_subtitle position-relative  __className_fdde39 " data-splitting="">Overview<!-- --> </h3></div><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title  " data-splitting="">Land Partnership</h3></div></div><div class="contentwrap mt-4"><p>Puravankara has constantly acquired and delivered value to its land partners.<br>We will be happy to partner with land owners in creating wealth for them.<br>Owners looking to partner with Puravankara to sell or jointly develop residential and commercial properties.<br>Consultants are also welcome in providing property details.</p></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-12"><div class="imgwrap mt-4 mt-md-0 position-relative" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)"><div class="sustainimg"><img alt="overview image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="img-fluid position-relative object-fit-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_7_40a9b6c9f8.svg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rotatebox topleft mt-5"><div class="animboxwrap"><svg width="86" height="89" viewBox="0 0 86 89" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="box-anim h-auto w-100"><rect class="svgbx1" x="-0.151921" y="0.690594" width="58.7168" height="58.7168" transform="matrix(-0.842515 0.538672 0.538672 0.842515 52.2014 6.16227)" stroke="url(#paint0_linear_2029_648)"></rect><rect class="svgbx2" x="0.000495225" y="0.707107" width="58.7168" height="58.7168" transform="matrix(-0.706611 0.707602 0.707602 0.706611 41.697 0.207107)" stroke="url(#paint1_linear_2029_648)"></rect><rect class="svgbx3" x="-0.289206" y="0.64526" width="58.7168" height="58.7168" transform="matrix(-0.934465 0.356054 0.356054 0.934465 60.9789 12.0886)" stroke="url(#paint2_linear_2029_648)"></rect><defs><linearGradient id="paint0_linear_2029_648" x1="0" y1="29.8584" x2="59.7168" y2="29.8584" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FFB200"></stop><stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#FFE19A"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FFB200"></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="paint1_linear_2029_648" x1="0" y1="29.8584" x2="59.7168" y2="29.8584" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop 